on></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>即日起至2026年7月4日中午12:00</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>二</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 全国各高等院校</span><strong><span>2027年应届本科毕业生</span></strong><span>（生物学、生物制造、生物工程、人工智能、化学工程等相关专业优先）。</span></p><p><span>2. 拥护党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>3. 学业成绩优秀，或科研领域有突出表现，预计可获得推免生推荐资格。</span></p><p><span>4. 对生物制造、合成生物学、AI+生物工程等方向有浓厚研究兴趣，具有较强的学术创新或实践应用能力，有志于报考直博生</span><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名材料</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>（一）复旦大学</span></strong></span></p><p><span>1. 个人简历（含证件照、本科期间学习科研工作简介、对未来读研和职业的初步设想等），PDF格式。</span></p><p><span>2. 本科阶段现有完整成绩单（加盖教务处或院系公章），PDF格式。</span></p><p><span>3. 填写完整的报名信息表（附件1），EXCEL格式。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）北京化工大学</span></span></strong></p></section><section><p><span>1．个人简历（格式不限）。</span></p><p><span>2．本科生成绩单。</span></p><p><span>3．英语水平证明材料（如四/六级、托福、雅思等）。</span></p><p><span>4．相关证明材料（如获奖证书，发表论文等）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（一）复旦大学</span></span></strong><span><br/></span><span>       全部报名材料（简历、成绩单、信息表）请打包发送至生物技术学院邮箱：</span><span><span>gsyjw@fudan.edu.cn, 邮件主题为【2026复旦大学直博体验营报名-本科院校-姓名】。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）北京化工大学</span></span></strong></p><p><span>申请人登录北京化工大学研究生报考服务系统（</span><span><span>https://yzbm.buct.edu.cn/logon）进行注册报名。同时在报名系统中上传材料电子版，无须寄送纸质材料。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>五</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>相关说明</span></b></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 本次体验营预计2026年</span><strong><span>7月10-11日</span></strong><span>在复旦大学举行，</span><strong><span>7月13-14日</span></strong><span>在北京化工大学举行，计划营员人数分别约150名。活动内容包括生物制造相关领域介绍、师生交流、实地参观等，具体安排另行通知</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>2. 申请人</span><strong><span>可选择申报复旦大学、北京化工大学其中一所</span></strong><span>，也</span><strong><span>可同时申报两所</span></strong><span>。报名即</span><strong><span>默认可</span></strong><strong><span>参与线下活动</span></strong><span>。仅申报单一院校的同学，入营后可线上旁听另一院校举办的公开学术讲座，不参与该院校的师生交流、实地参观等环节</span><span><span>。联报学生将同时进入两校的筛选池，同等条件下优先入选。</span></span></p><p><span>3. 申请人须确保报名信息与材料真实有效。如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消参营资格并通报所在院校。</span></p><p><span>4. 若上级部门和学校关于体验营活动有新要求，将按新要求执行并及时通知申请人。</span></p><p><span>5. 咨询方式：</span></p><p><span>- 复旦大学生物技术学院</span></p><p><span>电话：021‑65644628</span></p><p><span>邮箱：gsyjw@fudan.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>- 北京化工大学生命科学与技术学院</span></p><p><span>电话：010-64416428</span></p><p><span>邮箱：zhiweimi@buct.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>复旦大学生物技术学院</span></p><p><span>北京化工大学生命科学与技术学院</span></p><p><span>2026年6月</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Q5udaM9uJ_GVr45FIiTMwA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1复旦大学报名信息表.xlsx</a></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Y2p3eQxeNiciaptonAZetA4ibS4ibpZ7XibNfNhaPKr2aZIOfzj1XSXPl4JyU2